              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Given chat history: {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}} and user's current request: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nClassify the request into one of the following intents and don't return anything else:\nworkWithBGD or general\n\nIf the user's request is to create, update, activate, deactivate a BGD for a product or recommend persona, account criteria and behaviour criteria (segments) segments for that BGD then output \"workWithBGD\"\nbut if the user is asking general question, anything unrelated, asking to delete BGD, asking for all the existing BGDs, asking about the existing products then output \"general\"\nand suppose user's ask is to show, create, update or activate a persona, account criteria and behaviour criteria (segments) that are not related to creating a BGD then output \"workWithSegments\""
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
