          "id": "1772630096601",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772630096602_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Given the user's request: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} and previous chat history: {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}\nAll Buying Group Definitions (BGDs) related to given product: {{$context.$nodes.GET_ALL_PRODUCT_RELATED_BGDS.$output}}\nInstructions:\\n- Output ONLY one word: \"yes\" or \"no\".\nDO NOT provide any explanation, sentence, or extra text.\n\nLogic:\n1. If user's request is to create a BGD then check if a BGD for the product is active or not. If no BGD is published and is in active state then only output \"no\". But if a BGD is already in published active state then output \"yes\"\n2. If user's request is to show, update, activate, deactivate, or similar: If BGD exists in the provided BGDs → output \\\"yes\\\". Otherwise, output \\\"no\\\".\n3. If BGD list is empty then output \"no\".\n\nFinal rule:\nYour entire response must be exactly either \"yes\" or \"no\" with no additional text."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
