          "code": "PROMPT_FOR_ACTIVATION_BEFORE_AGENT",
          "id": "1774518840819",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774518840822_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "According to the given user request: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} and the chat history: {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}\n\nIf the user's request is to activate a BGD which is not active, you should first check if there is another BGD that is currently activated/published for the product. If not then go ahead and write output for the agent with the details. If there's an activate BGD then write output for the agent saying that the following BGD is already active/published, deactivate it first and then activate the said BGD. If user's request is to deactivate then you can deactivate that BGD.\n\nOutput the BGD id/s and tell what to do with it/them.\nLike output can be:\n[(bgd1_id, activate)]\nor \n[(bgd1_id, deactivate), (bgd2_id, activate)]\n\nHere are all the product related BGDs: {{$context.$nodes.GET_ALL_PRODUCT_RELATED_BGDS.$output}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
