          "code": "CREATE_BGD_OR_SEGMENTS",
          "id": "1774880431652",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774880431653_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Given the current user message: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} and the chat history: {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}\nHere's the context: {{$context.$nodes.BGD_CREATE_AGENT_CONTEXT.$output}}\n\nYour job is to decide whether the agent should create BGD when complete information given, work with segments, recommend complete BGD or just create BGD but with incomplete information, according to the recent conversation.\nIf your answer is  to work with (account criteria/persona criteria/behavior criteria) segment then output \"segment\", if the agent should create the BGD given the complete information (about all account, persona and behavior segments) then it should output \"createBGD\", if the request is to recommend a complete BGD first then output \"recommend\" and if the information is incomplete about account criteria, behavior criteria or persona criteria but user asks to create BGD then output \"incompleteCreate\".\nIf the user says to create BGD with mentioning account criteria, persona or behavior then also output \"segment\" (since we'll work with segments to check their existence in system one by one."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
