          "id": "1774947874907",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774947874908_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Given the user's request: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} and the summarized context: {{$context.$nodes.BGD_CREATE_AGENT_CONTEXT.$output}}\n\nHere are the available account criteria segments: {{$context.$nodes.GET_BGACCOUNT_SEGMENTS.$output}}\nThe available buyer roles: {{$context.$nodes.GET_BUYER_ROLES.$output}}\npersona segments: {{$context.$nodes.GET_BGPERSONA_SEGMENTS.$output}} \nand behavior criteria segments: {{$context.$nodes.GET_BGBEHAVIOR_SEGMENTS.$output}}\n\nYour job is to recommend a complete BGD for the given user's request.\nOutput the following:\n1. Profile:\na. Buying Group Profile Name\nb. Buying Group Profile Description\nc. Product Id\nd. Product Name\n\n2. Criteria:\n2.1. Persona Segment alongwith Buyer role in array form:\na. buyerRoleName\nb. name\nc. description\nd. buyerRolePriority\n\n2.2. Behavior Segments alongwith buyer role in array form:\na. buyerRoleName\nb. name\nc. description\nd. buyerRolePriority\n\n2.3. Account Segments in array form:\na. name\nb. description\n\nAt the end of this ask user if they want to create it as-is, customize it, or do you want help with something else."
            }
