          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775119157448_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Given the user message: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} and chat history: {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}\nHere's the context: {{$context.$nodes.BGD_CREATE_AGENT_CONTEXT.$output}}\n\n Here's the id of the newly created segment if there was segment creation: {{$context.$nodes.GET_SEGMENT_ID_OF_CREATED_SEGMENT.$output}} and if the segment already existed then here's it's output: {{$context.$nodes.GET_EXISTING_SEGMENTS.$output}}\n\nSo the Buying Group Profile (BGD) is created using account criteria, persona criteria with buyer roles and behavior criteria with roles.\nSo if the agent is in process of making BGD but first, and account criteria is taken from user. Then output to provide persona criteria with buyer roles. If persona criteria were made/checked just now. Then ask user for behavior criteria with roles. And if that's also done then ask, user if agent can go ahead with creation of BGD."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
