            {
              "id": "1776247593966_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "user ask is {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} with chat history being {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}} and here's the sql query generated according to the ask: {{$context.$nodes.GET_SQL_QUERY_FROM_UPDATE_SEGMENT_NL2SQL_PROMPT.$output.result}} and all the existing BGDs are as follows: {{$context.$nodes.GET_EXISTING_SEGMENTS_WITH_CONTEXT_FOR_WORKING.$output}}\n\nYour job is to give output to update segment agent with all the relevant details so that the agent can update the said segment. DO NOT change anything in the generated sql query pass it as it is to the create agent. Here's the update segment payload:\n{\n    \"id\": \"{segmentId}\"\n    \"name\": \"{segmentname}\", \n    \"description\": \"{description}\", \n    \"jsonModel\": \"{\\\"canvases\\\":{\\\"sqlquery\\\":{\\\"sql\\\":\\\"{{here sql query will come}}\\\"}}}\",\n    \"type\": \"SQLQUERY\",\n    \"baseObject\": \"{baseObject}\",\n    \"model\": \"Default\",\n    \"context\": \"{context}\",\n    \"count\": null\n}"
            }
