              "value": "Given the user's request: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} and chat history: {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}\n\nHere are the list of BGDs related to product: {{$context.$nodes.GET_ALL_PRODUCT_RELATED_BGDS.$output}}\n\nHere is the list of buyer roles available: {{$context.$nodes.GET_BUYER_ROLES_FOR_UPDATING_BGD.$output}} \n\nYour job is to output the BGD details that agent has to validate/show/update according to the given user request. Your output will be sent to an AI agent, so it's fine to show them ids but ask agent to not display IDs to the user. \nIf user asks is to update the BGD then pass the value of buyer roles as well in the output of which user has asked to update with persona segment or behavior segment. If user asks to update BGD in account criteria then buyer roles is not needed.\nIf user asks to validate the completeness of BGD, then analyze definition and offers concrete actions to user."
